  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "排练请吃饭的台词  (Rehearsing a Dinner Invitation)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "lin_jie": "林姐"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Convinced by Xingzi's hint that Chun Yuqiao secretly likes her, Bu Xiaogu stands outside the studio rehearsing how to invite him to dinner until Lin Jie walks past. Listen to the Mandarin dialogue.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我听杏子姐的意思，你是看上我了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你是不是真的看上我了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "内涵，我一定要注重一下内涵！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，其实我就是想请你吃个饭。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们俩正好探讨一下专业方面的知识。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我一直觉得，你既可以当我的老师，又可以当我的伴侣。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果两口子都是搞同一个专业的，是不是还挺和谐的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "气质，一定要注意气质！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我觉得我看你哪儿都好，哪儿哪儿都好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "小谷，你在这儿干吗呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "你是过来找老大的吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "他就在里面呢，你赶快进去吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我听杏子姐的意思，你是看上我了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao, from what Xingzi implied, have you taken a liking to me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你是不是真的看上我了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you really fallen for me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "内涵，我一定要注重一下内涵！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Depth—I need to focus on showing some inner depth!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，其实我就是想请你吃个饭。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao, actually I just wanted to treat you to a meal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们俩正好探讨一下专业方面的知识。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The two of us can discuss professional topics together.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我一直觉得，你既可以当我的老师，又可以当我的伴侣。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have always felt you could be my mentor and my partner as well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果两口子都是搞同一个专业的，是不是还挺和谐的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If a couple both work in the exact same field, would that not be quite harmonious?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "气质，一定要注意气质！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Poise—I must mind my poise!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我觉得我看你哪儿都好，哪儿哪儿都好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao, I think everything about you looks wonderful, every single thing!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "小谷，你在这儿干吗呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, what are you doing out here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "你是过来找老大的吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You came looking for the boss, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "他就在里面呢，你赶快进去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is right inside; hurry on in.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
